# Gymnastics system

This is my web-based system that is built to register and manage gymnasts and is built using PHP, MySQL, JS, React and Node.JS

## Setup

1. have ampps running
2. open phpMyAdmin, import the gymnastics_db.sql
3. open http://localhost/gymnastics/php/index.php

## login credentials

for admin

- Email: admin@gym.com
- Password: admin123 

for gymnast the login is set by the admin during registration

## user roles

Admin:

- Register new gymnasts
- view the gymnasts in a table
- be able to search or filter gymnasts
- view the individual profiles of the gymnasts
- edit or delete the gymnasts information

Gymnast:

- view their profile
- download or print their summary report and their enrollment confirmation slip

## technologies used

- PHP
- MySQL
- HTML
- css
- Javascript
- React
- Node.js
- mysql2

## security choices

- passwords are hashed
- database queries use PDO prepared statements
- output uses htmlspecialchars
- role-based access control
- input validation

## how to generate report

Log in as a gymnast and use the navbar to access the

- profile summary report which shows all the person details that can be printed
- enrollment confirmation slip to show registration details and status

